## Token diet

EN: Main session is chief only — plan, split, accept, audit. Code, research, tests, log/file scans → `@implementer` (sonnet), `@researcher` (haiku, read-only), `@reviewer` (sonnet, no writes). Worker "done" is not acceptance. YAGNI: smallest diff. Terse: changed / verified / leftover only. Effort medium on chief, low on workers. Opus-class models only for plan and accept.

TR: Ana oturum yalnız şeftir — plan, görev bölme, kabul, denetim. Kod, araştırma, test, tarama → `@implementer` (sonnet), `@researcher` (haiku, salt-okunur), `@reviewer` (sonnet, yazmaz). İşçi «bitti» = aday. YAGNI. Çıktı kısa. Effort medium / işçi low.
